        "type": "comment",
        "z": "01df77f7ae4c4f86",
        "name": "Flow to adjust parameters",
        "info": "ES\nEste flujo ajusta parametros de simulacion (camaras, probabilidades, ritmo) desde varios injects, los guarda en flow, construye un payload con defaults si falta algun valor y lo envia por HTTP POST a /admin/update, mostrando el payload y la respuesta en debug.\n\nEN \nThis flow updates simulation parameters (cameras, probabilities, pacing) via inject nodes, stores them in flow, builds a payload with defaults when a value is missing, and sends it by HTTP POST to /admin/update, showing both the payload and the response in the debug panel.",
